# OAT 钩子(scripts/oat_check.sh)要求存在未锚定的 log/ 条目, 缺失时会自动改写
# 本文件导致 pre-commit "files were modified by this hook" 失败, 故保留 log/;
# 同时用例外放行在册日志模块头文件目录, 保持锚定 PR 的修复意图。
log/
!core/utils/include/log/

# coverage tool and lint caches
lcov/
lcov-1.16/
.ruff_cache/
oat_reports*/
sip_pta/dist/
sip_pta/*.egg-info/
